    "title": "Funky Maker: Mobile!",
    "description": "Welcome to Funky Maker: Mobile!\r\n\r\nWith this app, you can download, play, and create your own musical levels easily, comfortably, and quickly.\r\n\r\nDesign your own levels and share them with your friends; you can even submit them to our game servers for the whole world to enjoy your creations!\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the action as you catch arrows to the rhythm of the music, aiming for the highest scores and mastering the game!",
